{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Returns the TCMB bulletin published on a given date (history back to 1996). If no bulletin was published that day (weekend, holiday, or today before ~15:30 TRT), returns the previous bulletin with is_fallback=true and a fallback_reason. Bulletins before 2005-01-01 are in old Turkish lira (domestic_currency TRL). Source: Central Bank of the Republic of T\u00fcrkiye (CBRT/TCMB) daily indicative bulletin, published on business days around 15:30 T\u00fcrkiye time (UTC+3). Rates are TRY per `unit` of currency (JPY is per 100). Decimals are strings. Every result includes source_url, bulletin_date and a disclaimer; rates are indicative, not for official use.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"currencies":{"description":"Currency codes to include; omit for all (about 20 currencies)","items":{"description":"ISO 4217 code, e.g. USD","pattern":"^[A-Za-z]{3}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":50,"type":"array"},"date":{"description":"Bulletin date, YYYY-MM-DD","pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"}},"required":["date"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_rates_on_date","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"bulletin_date":{"type":"string"},"bulletin_no":{"type":["string","null"]},"disclaimer":{"type":"string"},"domestic_currency":{"enum":["TRY","TRL"],"type":"string"},"fallback_reason":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["no_bulletin_weekend_or_holiday","not_yet_published"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"is_fallback":{"type":"boolean"},"rates":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"banknote_buying":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^\\d+(\\.\\d+)?$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"banknote_selling":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^\\d+(\\.\\d+)?$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"code":{"type":"string"},"cross_rate_euro":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^\\d+(\\.\\d+)?$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"cross_rate_other":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^\\d+(\\.\\d+)?$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"cross_rate_usd":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^\\d+(\\.\\d+)?$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"forex_buying":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^\\d+(\\.\\d+)?$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"forex_selling":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^\\d+(\\.\\d+)?$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"name_en":{"type":"string"},"name_tr":{"type":"string"},"unit":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["code","name_tr","name_en","unit","forex_buying","forex_selling","banknote_buying","banknote_selling","cross_rate_usd","cross_rate_other"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"requested_date":{"type":["string","null"]},"retrieved_at":{"type":"string"},"source":{"const":"TCMB","type":"string"},"source_url":{"format":"uri","type":"string"}},"required":["source","source_url","bulletin_date","bulletin_no","requested_date","is_fallback","fallback_reason","domestic_currency","retrieved_at","rates","disclaimer"],"type":"object"},"title":"Turkish central bank exchange rates on a date"}
